      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Finding a way out doesn't always mean a physical escape. Sometimes, it's about finding a way to feel less trapped. Maybe it's time to consider a different approach, even if it feels like a step backward. You could try reaching out to someone, even if it's just a friend or a professional who can help you navigate this feeling. It's never too late to try something new, even if it feels daunting. Remember, you're not alone in this.",
